# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. No secrets: the Scribe uses the AI binding
# through AI Gateway (pre-authenticated within the account).
# LLM mode: SCRIBE_MODE=llm, or auto with GATE_TEST_MODE!=scripted. Otherwise the
# deterministic extractive summarizer is used.

# Optional overrides of wrangler.jsonc vars:
# GATE_TEST_MODE=scripted
# SCRIBE_MODE=llm
# MODEL_SCRIBE=@cf/zai-org/glm-4.7-flash
# POLICY_ALLOWED_DEPS=hono,zod,@queenos/*
